{"4951420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doomgard", "steam_appid": 4951420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold earth breathes beneath you. You are surrounded by tall grass, ancient stones, dense forests, and the sound of distant waves. You don’t know who you are. You don’t know how you got here. You are left with only one feeling: you shouldn’t be here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doomgard is an atmospheric, open-world survival adventure game where exploration, crafting, building, and the gradual unraveling of mysteries go hand in hand. Chop wood, gather stone, craft weapons and tools, build a home in the wilderness, and then set out to find the pieces of your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this world is not empty. Something is watching. The ancient statues, the cold flames, the strange messages, and the portals all hint at the same thing: you have been here before. Maybe not even once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end. Memory is a prison. The only question is: will you fight, will you rise, or will you finally rest?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cold earth breathes beneath you. You are surrounded by tall grass, ancient stones, dense forests, and the sound of distant waves. You don’t know who you are. You don’t know how you got here. You are left with only one feeling: you shouldn’t be here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doomgard is an atmospheric, open-world survival adventure game where exploration, crafting, building, and the gradual unraveling of mysteries go hand in hand. Chop wood, gather stone, craft weapons and tools, build a home in the wilderness, and then set out to find the pieces of your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this world is not empty. Something is watching. The ancient statues, the cold flames, the strange messages, and the portals all hint at the same thing: 